#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/starlabs-starfighter.rst:8
#: fd62a6fca3924f518c28f7d79c8a4b38
msgid ""
"The `Star Labs StarFighter <https://starlabs.systems/pages/starfighter>`__ "
"is :doc:`officially certified </user/hardware/certified-hardware/certified-"
"hardware>` for Qubes OS Release 4."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/starlabs-starfighter.rst:10
#: 29fa6242c3a243e2a1ea2f5ab0f8cd5d
msgid ""
"The `Star Labs StarFighter <https://starlabs.systems/pages/starfighter>`__ "
"is a 16-inch laptop featuring open-source coreboot firmware, disabled Intel "
"ME, up to 64 GB of memory, wireless kill switch, removable webcam, as well "
"as extensive firmware controls for fan, power, security, boot behavior, and "
"more."
msgstr ""

