#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/starlabs-starfighter.rst:55
#: 385a48eb35fc4d3ab207d947bf6e496e
msgid "Disclaimers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/starlabs-starfighter.rst:58
#: 67343257a040424286a7ea5c9ef3b5f4
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, while both the QHD and 4K display variants will work, "
"the 4K display will run at a lower resolution (Full HD) due to the absence "
"of proper support for HiDPI in Qubes OS. While users can manually change the "
"resolution to 4K, we cannot guarantee everything will work properly. For "
"example, there are known issues with both UI scaling and full-screen video "
"playback performance in 4K. This limitation may be lifted in a future Qubes "
"OS release."
msgstr ""
